<goodsDescription><![CDATA[<style>\r\n    /* DJI Osmo Nano Detailed Style */\r\n    .nano-full-wrapper {\r\n        width: 100%; \r\n        max-width: 1000px;\r\n        margin: 0 auto;\r\n        background-color: #fff;\r\n        font-family: \'Pretendard\', \'Malgun Gothic\', sans-serif;\r\n        color: #333;\r\n        line-height: 1.6;\r\n    }\r\n    .nano-section { margin-bottom: 60px; text-align: center; padding: 0 20px; }\r\n    .nano-header { font-size: 38px; font-weight: 800; margin-bottom: 20px; color: #111; letter-spacing: -1px; }\r\n    .nano-sub { font-size: 20px; color: #FF7B00; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 15px; display: block; text-transform: uppercase; }\r\n    .nano-text { font-size: 17px; color: #555; max-width: 700px; margin: 0 auto 40px; word-break: keep-all; }\r\n    .nano-img { width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; display: block; margin: 0 auto; border-radius: 12px; }\r\n    .nano-video-box { position: relative; padding-bottom: 56.25%; height: 0; overflow: hidden; max-width: 100%; background: #000; border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 50px; box-shadow: 0 10px 30px rgba(0,0,0,0.1); }\r\n    .nano-video-box iframe { position: absolute; top: 0; left: 0; width: 100%; height: 100%; border: 0; }\r\n    .nano-divider { height: 1px; background: #eee; margin: 60px auto; max-width: 800px; border: none; }\r\n</style>\r\n\r\n<div class=\"nano-full-wrapper\">\r\n\r\n    <div class=\"nano-section\" style=\"margin-top: 50px;\">\r\n        <span class=\"nano-sub\">NEW ARRIVAL</span>\r\n        <h1 class=\"nano-header\">다양한 시점을 위한<br>웨어러블 카메라</h1>\r\n        <p class=\"nano-text\">작지만 강력한 1/1.3인치 센서. 52g의 가벼움.<br>DJI Osmo Nano로 일상의 모든 순간을 영화처럼 기록하세요.</p>\r\n        <img src=\"http://dronetr7262.godomall.com/data/goods/260115/Osmo%20nano/JPG_1.jpg\" class=\"nano-img\" alt=\"메인 이미지\">\r\n    </div>\r\n\r\n    <div class=\"nano-section\">\r\n        <div class=\"nano-video-box\">\r\n            <iframe src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/yECD9TzmW-A?rel=0&amp;modestbranding=1\" title=\"DJI Osmo Nano Intro\" allow=\"accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture\" allowfullscreen=\"\"></iframe>\r\n        </div>\r\n    </div>\r\n\r\n    <div class=\"nano-section\">\r\n        <h2 class=\"nano-header\" style=\"font-size: 30px;\">선택해야 하는 <span style=\"color:#FF7B00;\">8가지 이유</span></h2>\r\n        <img src=\"http://dronetr7262.godomall.com/data/goods/260115/Osmo%20nano/JPG_2.jpg\" class=\"nano-img\" alt=\"8가지 특징\">\r\n    </div>\r\n\r\n    <hr class=\"nano-divider\">\r\n\r\n    <div class=\"nano-section\">\r\n        <h3 class=\"nano-header\" style=\"font-size: 28px;\">초경량 디자인, 자유로운 착용</h3>\r\n        <p class=\"nano-text\">1인칭 시점(POV) 촬영에 최적화되었습니다.<br>자석 마그네틱으로 옷, 가방, 모자 어디든 간편하게 부착하세요.</p>\r\n        <img src=\"http://dronetr7262.godomall.com/data/goods/260115/Osmo%20nano/JPG_3.jpg\" class=\"nano-img\" alt=\"착용 샷\">\r\n    </div>\r\n\r\n    <div class=\"nano-section\">\r\n        <h3 class=\"nano-header\" style=\"font-size: 28px;\">컴팩트한 바디, 넓은 화면</h3>\r\n        <p class=\"nano-text\">동급 최강 1/1.3인치 센서가 선사하는 놀라운 야간 화질.<br>4K/60fps의 부드러운 영상미를 경험해보세요.</p>\r\n        <img src=\"http://dronetr7262.godomall.com/data/goods/260115/Osmo%20nano/JPG_4.jpg\" class=\"nano-img\" alt=\"화질 성능\">\r\n    </div>\r\n\r\n    <div class=\"nano-section\">\r\n        <h3 class=\"nano-header\" style=\"font-size: 28px;\">어떤 촬영에도 완벽하게 준비</h3>\r\n        <p class=\"nano-text\">최대 200분 촬영(케이스 포함). 방수 기능 탑재로<br>비 오는 날에도, 물놀이 중에도 걱정 없습니다.</p>\r\n        <img src=\"http://dronetr7262.godomall.com/data/goods/260115/Osmo%20nano/JPG_5.jpg\" class=\"nano-img\" alt=\"배터리 방수\">\r\n    </div>\r\n\r\n    <div class=\"nano-section\">\r\n        <img src=\"http://dronetr7262.godomall.com/data/goods/260115/Osmo%20nano/JPG_6.jpg\" class=\"nano-img\" alt=\"액세서리 호환\">\r\n    </div>\r\n\r\n    <hr class=\"nano-divider\">\r\n\r\n    <div class=\"nano-section\">\r\n        <h3 class=\"nano-header\" style=\"font-size: 28px;\">창의적인 순간을 위한 기능</h3>\r\n        <img src=\"http://dronetr7262.godomall.com/data/goods/260115/Osmo%20nano/JPG_7.jpg\" class=\"nano-img\" alt=\"다양한 모드\">\r\n    </div>\r\n\r\n    <div class=\"nano-section\">\r\n        <img src=\"http://dronetr7262.godomall.com/data/goods/260115/Osmo%20nano/JPG_8.jpg\" class=\"nano-img\" alt=\"액세서리 종류\">\r\n    </div>\r\n\r\n    <hr class=\"nano-divider\">\r\n\r\n    <div class=\"nano-section\">\r\n        <h3 class=\"nano-header\" style=\"font-size: 28px;\">구성품 (In the Box)</h3>\r\n        <p class=\"nano-text\">구매 전 옵션별 구성품을 확인하세요.</p>\r\n        <img src=\"http://dronetr7262.godomall.com/data/goods/260115/Osmo%20nano/JPG_9.jpg\" class=\"nano-img\" alt=\"구성품 목록\">\r\n    </div>\r\n\r\n    <div class=\"nano-section\">\r\n        <h3 class=\"nano-header\" style=\"font-size: 24px; color:#888;\">상세 사양</h3>\r\n        <img src=\"http://dronetr7262.godomall.com/data/goods/260115/Osmo%20nano/JPG_10.jpg\" class=\"nano-img\" alt=\"스펙 테이블\">\r\n    </div>\r\n\r\n    <div style=\"text-align: center; padding: 50px 20px; background-color: #f9f9f9; border-radius: 12px; margin-top: 40px;\">\r\n        <p style=\"color: #666; font-size: 14px; margin-bottom: 10px;\">※ 본 페이지의 제품 사양 및 구성은 제조사의 정책에 따라 예고 없이 변경될 수 있습니다.</p>\r\n        <p style=\"font-weight: bold; font-size: 16px; color: #333;\">DJI 공식 판매점 [드론박스]</p>\r\n    </div>\r\n\r\n</div>]]></goodsDescription>
